       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MICRO-XRF.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MICRO-XRF-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MOSELEY-EMISS-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FUNDAMENTAL-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CORE-DEMARC-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-XRF-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-XRF-SEAL-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MICRO-XRF-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PXF-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PXF-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MOSELEY-AND-FUND.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DEMARC-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PXF-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MOSELEY-AND-FUND.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOSELEY-EMISS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FUNDAMENTAL-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DEMARC-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CORE-DEMARC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-XRF-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PXF-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MOSELEY-EMISS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FUNDAMENTAL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CORE-DEMARC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-XRF-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-XRF-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PXF-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PXF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PXF-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PXF-CODE.
